        // ---- Cascade selection (view-space |z|). ----------------------------
        // Start at cascade 0 and walk up while this fragment is past each split.
        // Splits beyond \`uShadowCascadeCount - 1\` are MAX_VALUE so they never
        // trigger an upgrade.
